Taxi Move is the app of Italian taxi drivers conceived for the customer: it provides immediate quotation, it allows taxi booking, online payments and ride review. You can use Taxi Move in Florence, Modena, Siena, Livorno, Brescia, Pisa, Bergamo and Reggio Emilia.

HOW IT WORKS
- open the app and get your quotation;
- call your taxi or book it for later;
- choose the taxi you need: from 1 to 8 people, with e-payment, with English-speaking driver or any other feature you wish you nave;
- check on your smartphone when your taxi arrives;
- pay the ride with the method you like;
- review your ride.


WHERE IT WORKS
Taxi Move is now available in Florence, Modena, Siena, Livorno, Brescia, Pisa, Bergamo and Reggio Emilia. The covered area is growing steadily!

FEATURES
Safety is our taxies first feature, thanks to our drivers certified professionality. Every taxi is geolocated.

Our drivers have a thorough knowledge of our towns, therefore they can bring you everywhere very fast.


Waiting time has never been so low. Surveys prove that over 90% of taxi researches succeed by 6 minutes!

Kindness and helpfulness are the features that all our drivers have, thanks to their customer-friendliness and their work commitment.



Visit our official website: https://www.taximove.it/

